  "steps":[{"id":"s1","section":"比大小","title":"作差法：通分并判断差的符号","t":0,"showDiagram":false,"reasoning":[{"kind":"because","text":"使用作差法，用右式减左式：\\(\\frac{a+m}{b+m}-\\frac{b}{a}\\)。"},{"kind":"because","text":"由 \\(a>b>0\\)、\\(m>0\\)，得 \\(a>0\\)、\\(b+m>0\\)，所以公分母 \\(a(b+m)>0\\)。"},{"kind":"because","text":"通分并因式分解：\\(\\frac{a+m}{b+m}-\\frac{b}{a}=\\frac{a(a+m)-b(b+m)}{a(b+m)}=\\frac{(a-b)(a+b+m)}{a(b+m)}\\)。"},{"kind":"because","text":"\\(a-b>0\\)、\\(a+b+m>0\\)，且分母大于 0，所以右式减左式大于 0。"},{"kind":"therefore","text":"因此 \\(\\frac{b}{a}<\\frac{a+m}{b+m}\\)。"}],"derive":[["使用方法","作差法"],["右式-左式",">0"],["关系符号","<"]]}],
